No.  Your chances are too low, and it is just a weapon.  Weapons aren't 
important past the midgame; any old +6 pointy stick will do.  Besides, 
you already have a better weapon -- Magicbane.  Enchant it up.

What you *should* do, if you have a neutral altar, is self-convert and 
carry the Eye, which is far superior to Grayswandir. (If you care about 
ascending with the Mirror, don't drop it afterwards, because you will not 
be able to pick it up again.)

Don't forget to enchant your robe and SDSM to +4/+5.  I would not enchant 
the speed boots yet, because you may want to replace them with jumping 
boots.  Good job getting conflict; that has to be worth about 20 points 
of AC.


